---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  noindex
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy - La Mandrágora Restaurant"
  description="Privacy policy of La Mandrágora Restaurant: what data we collect, how we use it, and how to exercise your rights."
>
  <div class="relative min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24 text-gray-300 overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="absolute top-20 left-10 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-600/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-20 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-600/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif text-white tracking-wide mb-4"
        >
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-brand-500 tracking-widest text-xs uppercase">
          Last updated: June 2026
        </p>
        <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-brand-600 mx-auto mt-6"></div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed bg-[#070708]/40 border border-brand-950/10 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-sm backdrop-blur-md"
      >
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            1. Introduction
          </h2>
          <p>
            At <strong>La Mandrágora Restaurant</strong>, we take the privacy of
            our guests and visitors very seriously. This Privacy Policy details
            how we collect, use, and protect the personal information you
            provide to us, whether through our website, direct bookings, phone
            calls, or WhatsApp messages.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            2. Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p>
            Since this is an informational website without an automated user
            account or registration system, we only collect personal information
            that you voluntarily choose to provide when requesting a table
            reservation:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-400">
            <li>
              <strong>Booking Details:</strong> Full name, telephone number, email
              address, date and time of visit, and party size.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Contact Channels:</strong> Information shared through phone
              calls, text messages, or WhatsApp chat.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Browsing Cookies:</strong> If analytics tools (such as Google
              Analytics) or marketing pixels are active, non-personally identifiable
              technical data about your device and browsing activity on our website
              may be gathered.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            3. Use of Information
          </h2>
          <p>We strictly use your information for the following purposes:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-gray-400">
            <li>
              To manage, confirm, and follow up on your table reservations.
            </li>
            <li>
              To contact you regarding unexpected schedule updates or special
              event arrangements.
            </li>
            <li>
              To improve the technical performance and user experience of our
              website.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="italic text-brand-500/90 pt-1">
            * Under no circumstances do we sell, rent, or share your personal
            information with third-party companies for commercial marketing or
            mass advertising (spam).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            4. Data Security
          </h2>
          <p>
            We adopt reasonable technical and organizational measures to prevent
            loss, misuse, unauthorized access, or alteration of the contact
            details you share with us. Personal details are managed exclusively
            by authorized staff handling reservations for La Mandrágora.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            5. Your Rights
          </h2>
          <p>
            You have the right at any time to know what contact information we
            hold, as well as to request updates, corrections, or permanent
            deletion from our reservation records. To do so, you may send a
            message directly to our WhatsApp channel or official email:
            <a
              href="mailto:reservas@lamandragora.pe"
              class="text-brand-500 hover:text-brand-400 underline transition-colors"
              >reservas@lamandragora.pe</a
            >.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl text-white font-serif tracking-wide">
            6. Changes to this Policy
          </h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to amend this policy in the future to adapt to
            new website features or legal requirements. We recommend reviewing
            this section periodically.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a
          href="/en/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border border-brand-600 text-white hover:bg-brand-600/10 transition-all duration-300 rounded-sm text-sm tracking-wider uppercase"
        >
          Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
